<div class="bg-base-100 px-6 py-8 text-base-content lg:col-span-8" role="status">
  <p class="type text-base-content/70">Request received</p>
  <p class="statement mt-3">Thank you, {{ record.name }}.</p>
  <p class="body-text mt-4">We have your request for the {{ record.piece }}{% if record.size %}, size {{ record.size }}{% endif %}{% if record.color %}, in {{ record.color | downcase }}{% endif %}. We will write to {{ record.email }} within two working days with the timing and a payment link.</p>
</div>
